{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"903454","name":"Trendy By Athens Prime Hotels","description":"With a stay at Trendy Hotel by Athens Prime Hotels, you'll be centrally located in Athens, within a 10-minute drive of Syntagma Square and Acropolis Museum. This 4-star hotel is 1. 8 mi (3 km) from Acropolis and 2. 5 mi (4 km) from Parthenon. Make use of convenient amenities, which include complimentary wireless Internet access and concierge services. Featured amenities include express check-out, a 24-hour front desk, and multilingual staff. Grab a bite from the snack bar/deli serving guests of Trendy Hotel by Athens Prime Hotels. Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 7:30 AM to 10:30 AM for a fee. Make yourself at home in one of the 44 air-conditioned rooms featuring Smart televisions. Complimentary wireless Internet access keeps you connected, and digital programming is available for your entertainment. Bathrooms feature bathtubs or showers, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. Conveniences include safes and desks, and housekeeping is provided daily.","address":"Klisovis, 8","city":"Athens","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"10677","lat":37.98608,"lng":23.73225,"stars":4,"giataCode":"1298457","phone":"+30 21 0380 4653","email":"TRENDY@ATHENSPRIMEHOTELS.COM","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/90/903454/903454a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/90/903454/903454a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/90/903454/903454a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/90/903454/903454a_hb_l_004.jpg","category":"lobby","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/90/903454/903454a_hb_l_003.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/90/903454/903454